{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-47","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：中项无理线段","englishTitle":"The side of the sum of two medial areas is divided at one point only.","book":10,"number":47,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.47","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.47/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":47,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","contentId":"euclid-10-47","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b967c1f6cb9e66573003dfaa3c905b3ce87f1c8b1af18e6a0fe49486de451d6","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-47.statement","euclid-10-47.construction.1","euclid-10-47.proof.1","euclid-10-47.proof.2","euclid-10-47.proof.3","euclid-10-47.proof.4","euclid-10-47.proof.5","euclid-10-47.proof.6","euclid-10-47.proof.7","euclid-10-47.proof.8","euclid-10-47.proof.9","euclid-10-47.proof.10","euclid-10-47.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-47.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-47","revisionId":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa605f8612ac08659b05921950906b00f3321553b735a48e7b369ba15e4b789d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The side of the sum of two medial areas is divided at one point only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个中项无理线段个区域之和的一边只划分一个点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-47.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-47","revisionId":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"632c61953cd59350d19347e16d21158674075de12bd4d45ee3b6a1f0611c3c80","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be divided at C, so that AC, CB are incommensurable in square and make the sum of the squares on AC, CB medial, and the rectangle AC, CB medial and also incommensurable with the sum of the squares on them; I say that AB is not divided at another point so as to fulfil the given conditions."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB分为C,这样正方形中有AC CB,正方形为不可公度,矩形为CB 中项无理线段,矩形 AC CB 中项无理线段和不可公度为正方形;我说,AB不是在另一时间分裂,以满足既定条件。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-47.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-47","revisionId":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"126f87d7861cfa804c202802defb689e2382aec1e38ee9fb81cb2de9bcc3d02c","citations":["euclid-2-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be divided at D, so that again AC is of course not the same as BD, but AC is supposed greater; let a rational straight line EF be set out, and let there be applied to EF the rectangle EG equal to the squares on AC, CB, and the rectangle HK equal to twice the rectangle AC, CB; therefore the whole EK is equal to the square on AB. [[II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,将其分为D,这样AC当然不等于BD,但AC应该更大;如果列出有理线段 EF,那么,对EF适用矩形 EG,相当于AC CB的正方形,矩形 HK,等于矩形 AC,AC的两倍;因此,整个EK等于AB的正方形 [ [II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-47.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-47","revisionId":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"29f34770474060c68f1e4c875cbbab613e92fa75b99e260094c968cb4cf1173f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let EL, equal to the squares on AD, DB, be applied to EF; therefore the remainder, twice the rectangle AD, DB, is equal to the remainder MK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EL,相当于AD,DB的正方形,适用于EF;因此,其余的为矩形,AD,DB的两倍,等于其余的MK。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-47.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-47","revisionId":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb9c9b881c86d11240afe77f172c084cde5c4ef95f7c85ff1226aedea2c35e84","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, by hypothesis, the sum of the squares on AC, CB is medial, therefore EG is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设是,AC和CB的正方形和中项无理线段,EG和中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-47.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-47","revisionId":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3741591bf8161f18bc0e283c9163e6f1490918c9e71a17549e73ac2608723a8d","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line EF; therefore HE is rational and incommensurable in length with EF. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 EF;因此,HE为有理和不可公度为EF [ [X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-47.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-47","revisionId":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d4abd271a5cdae71f2bdcc897495b86efc3e961830bae8af38324408c79b4a4b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason HN is also rational and incommensurable in length with EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,HN也为有理,不可公度为EF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-47.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-47","revisionId":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba78417aa401cdb7a60614af577bbfef3fe908f167c37770b3feb745cf45abd6","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the sum of the squares on AC, CB is incommensurable with twice the rectangle AC, CB, therefore EG is also incommensurable with GN, so that EH is also incommensurable with HN. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) , [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CB是不可公度,矩形是不可公度,是矩形,AC的两倍,CB,CB,EG也是不可公度,GN,EH也是不可公度,HN [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-47.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-47","revisionId":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a476744a612bded704d521f748b17d3e054ab4faecfdfd033043e4b529464d8","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are rational; therefore EH, HN are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore EN is a binomial straight line divided at H. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"它们是有理; 因此EH, HN是有理线段, 平方可公度而长度不可公度; 因此, EN是二项无理线段直线, 分为H [ [X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-47.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-47","revisionId":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bbe86e78fbe13dba5f6308a6c8d04704604cbc40b289da39cf14830d9a01b4a3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that it is also divided at M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,它也处于M时。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-47.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-47","revisionId":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e88c4915193ea6c4b7677a4e14191c499bfa228e052c9fd27954d88c7d2f7747","citations":["euclid-10-42"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And EH is not the same with MN; therefore a binomial has been divided at different points: which is absurd. [[X. 42](/principles/euclid-10-42) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EH和MN不一样, 因此二项无理线段在不同的点上被分开: 这是荒谬的 [ [X. 42](/principles/euclid-10-42)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-47.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-47","revisionId":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4aa25c39c08455b45923ff962d6b134bc14e547be3fd0ee1e62adc63544b9d08","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore a side of the sum of two medial areas is not divided at different points; therefore it is divided at one point only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,两个中项无理线段个区域之和的一面没有在不同点上分割,因此只在一个点上分割。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-47.source","contentId":"euclid-10-47","revisionId":"euclid-10-47@raw-6b967c1f6cb9e665","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"addd03e6b1225635b7f18a9c57fa22d2fd050922fa9c01aac70ea1f464208f64","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.47/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.47\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-47:euclid-2-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-47","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-47.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-2-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.47","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.47/","sourceLabel":"II. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-47:euclid-10-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-47","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-47.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.47","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.47/","sourceLabel":"X. 22"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-47:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-47","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-47.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.47","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.47/","sour